@* A file field whose Upload callback refuses an empty file: the component checks count, size and type itself,
   but an empty file (zero bytes) is the host's call, made in the callback with OmniUploadRequest.Reject. The
   field then shows the message as its error, offers no retry and does not keep the file. *@
<OmniStack Gap="OmniSpacing.Small">
    <OmniLabel For="upload-empty-file">Document to attach</OmniLabel>
    <OmniUpload Id="upload-empty-file" Upload="RefuseEmptyAsync" />
    <OmniText Tone="OmniTextTone.Muted">Choose a file with no content (zero bytes) to see it refused; any other file is accepted.</OmniText>
</OmniStack>
